00:39:37,861 --> 00:39:44,380
We had a fire control system that said in excess of 90 percent of the time we were going to

462
00:39:44,381 --> 00:39:48,200
hit what we were shooting at and kill it first time.

463
00:39:48,201 --> 00:39:54,580
To protect the crew, the Abrams is shielded by the most sophisticated armor ever developed.

464
00:39:54,581 --> 00:39:59,940
Made from depleted uranium, it has a density at least two and a half times greater than

